SetEnvIfNoCase User-Agent "ahref" bad_bot
Deny from env=bad_bot

############################################
## Hard block on Magento's stock installer + downloader.
## These are public PHP endpoints that ship with Magento 1 and have no
## business being reachable on a deployed instance. The installer can
## walk an attacker through a re-install wizard (creating a new admin
## with attacker-chosen creds) and even when bootstrap fails it leaks
## filesystem paths in the error response. install.php has also been
## removed from the repo as of 2026-06-01; this is belt-and-suspenders
## in case it ever gets re-added accidentally.
<FilesMatch "(?i)^(install|downloader)\.php$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

############################################
## SEO: noindex utility URLs that Google has crawled despite being
## (previously) disallowed in robots.txt — currency-switcher session
## URLs and Magento's HTML seo_sitemap pages. The robots.txt block
## made these "Indexed, though blocked by robots.txt" in GSC because
## Googlebot couldn't fetch them to read a noindex signal. We now
## ALLOW the crawl and serve X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow so the
## URLs drop from the index on the next crawl.
##
## The env var is set by RewriteRule [E=noindex_url:1] in the
## mod_rewrite block below (before the front-controller rewrite to
## /index.php — see the matching RewriteRules). mod_rewrite prefixes
## subrequest env vars with REDIRECT_, so the Header check uses
## REDIRECT_noindex_url. robots.txt has matching `Allow:` rules so
## Googlebot can fetch these URLs and see the noindex header.
##
## Two header variants:
##   - noindex_url        -> "noindex, nofollow"  (utility URLs with no
##                           crawlable links worth following: currency
##                           switcher, HTML seo_sitemap, customer/account)
##   - noindex_follow_url -> "noindex, follow"    (paginated listings via
##                           ?p=N: drop the thin/duplicate paginated view
##                           from the index but KEEP following links so
##                           product discovery is unaffected)
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow" env=REDIRECT_noindex_url
    Header always set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, follow" env=REDIRECT_noindex_follow_url
</IfModule>


